<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia raises 3.2 mln dinars in bond issue.</title>
<headline>Tunisia raises 3.2 mln dinars in bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Wednesday said it raised 3.2 million dinars from December's issue of treasury bonds, negotiable at the bourse (BTNB).</p>
<p>It said it sold five-year paper payable in equal annual tranches worth 3.2 million dinars at an 8.5-percent coupon rate.</p>
<p>The price was down one percentage point compared to its level last month, a result of the one-point cut last month in the money market rate to 7.8125 percent.</p>
<p>BTNB are issued each month on the first Tuesday. ($= one dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538  REUTER AB</p>
